  "solution": {
    "text": "<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>f</mi><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mn>2</mn><mo>-</mo><mi>x</mi></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mi>f</mi><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mn>2</mn><mo>+</mo><mi>x</mi></mrow></mfenced></math>&nbsp;and&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>f</mi><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mn>4</mn><mo>-</mo><mi>x</mi></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mi>f</mi><mo>(</mo><mn>4</mn><mo>+</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>)</mo></math><br /><br />Then curve is symmetric about&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>x</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn></math>&nbsp;and&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>x</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>4</mn></math><br /><br /><math><mo>&#8756;</mo><mi>&#160;</mi><mi>&#160;</mi><mi>&#160;</mi></math> The curve is periodic with period <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>4</mn></math><br /><br />Given <math><mrow><munderover><mo stretchy=\"false\">&#8747;</mo><mrow><mn>0</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></munderover><mrow><mi>f</mi><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>x</mi></mrow></mfenced><mi>d</mi><mi>x</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>5</mn></mrow></mrow></math><br /><br /><math><mrow><munderover><mo stretchy=\"false\">&#8747;</mo><mrow><mn>0</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>4</mn></mrow></munderover><mrow><mi>f</mi><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>x</mi></mrow></mfenced><mi>d</mi><mi>x</mi></mrow></mrow><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn><mrow><munderover><mo stretchy=\"false\">&#8747;</mo><mrow><mn>0</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></munderover><mrow><mi>f</mi><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>x</mi></mrow></mfenced><mi>d</mi><mi>x</mi></mrow></mrow><mo>=</mo><mn>10</mn></math><br /><br /><math><mrow><munderover><mo stretchy=\"false\">&#8747;</mo><mrow><mn>10</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>50</mn></mrow></munderover><mrow><mi>f</mi><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>x</mi></mrow></mfenced><mi>d</mi><mi>x</mi></mrow></mrow><mo>=</mo><mrow><munderover><mo stretchy=\"false\">&#8747;</mo><mrow><mn>2</mn><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mn>4</mn></mrow></mfenced><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>12</mn><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mn>4</mn></mrow></mfenced><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow></munderover><mrow><mi>f</mi><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>x</mi></mrow></mfenced><mi>d</mi><mi>x</mi></mrow></mrow></math><br /><br /><math><mo>=</mo><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mn>12</mn><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow></mfenced><mrow><munderover><mo stretchy=\"false\">&#8747;</mo><mrow><mn>0</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>4</mn></mrow></munderover><mrow><mi>f</mi><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>x</mi></mrow></mfenced><mi>d</mi><mi>x</mi></mrow></mrow></math><br /><br /><math><mo>=</mo><mn>10</mn><mo>&#215;</mo><mn>10</mn><mo>=</mo><mn>100</mn></math>",
